# X API proxy

- Proxy returns structured `{ error, code, hint }` — preserve that contract
- Sync-all: abort only on fatal codes (token/auth/credits); continue on `rate_limit` / `network_error`
- Do not reintroduce client bearer in production (`allowClientBearer` stays false)
- Prefer App-only Bearer for `X_BEARER_TOKEN`; OAuth user tokens belong to MCP/local flows only
